UNIFICATION_HYPOTHESIS:

All 5 structures might be instances of:
  "INTERACTION_PRIMITIVE": "Two or more entities exchange / transform / influence each other"

PATTERN: {
  "Entity_A (State) --interaction--> Entity_B (New State)",
  "Energy / Information / Material flows",
  "Results in observable change",
  "Can be deterministic or probabilistic"
}

Different domains just instantiate different entity types:
  - Causal: Abstract events / propositions
  - Social: Agents / actors
  - Genetic: Traits / alleles in organisms
  - Chemical: Molecules / electrons
  - Energy: Physical systems / particles

This is the DEEPEST principle: Interaction is universal substrate.

